defmodule <%= @module %>.RepoExtensions do
  @moduledoc """
  The PostgreSQL extensions the generated resources need (e.g. `pg_trgm`
  for trigram indexes), from the Bubble app's decisions. Generated:
  rewritten on every generation.

  `<%= @module %>.Repo.installed_extensions/0` (owned) must add them:

      ["ash-functions", "citext"] ++ <%= @module %>.RepoExtensions.all()

  A Repo scaffolded before this module existed (bubble_ex before WTF-406)
  does not call it and is never rewritten: add the call yourself, or the
  migrations of the indexes that need these extensions fail.
  `BubbleEx.Target.Phoenix.check_manifest/3` reports such a Repo
  (`extensions_unlisted`).
  """

  @doc "The extensions, sorted."
  def all, do: <%= inspect(@extensions) %>
end
